<ecoSpold xmlns="http://www.EcoInvent.org/EcoSpold02">
  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="84b1f6b3-23ff-5b98-97dc-0e6929faae55" activityNameId="dc303440-56e4-5ab2-aae3-42451d471673" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Ventilation system, decentralized, 6 x 120 m3/h, PE ducts, with GHE</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Ventilation system, decentralized, 6 x 120 m3/h, PE ducts, with GHE
Ventilation system for a multi family house. The house considered in the investigation includes 6 flats with 130 m2 floor area each and a ventilation rate of 120 m3/h. The influence of a smaller concrete demand due to embedment of ventilation tubes in the concrete of the floor (-4.86 kg concrete per m2 floor area) is not included.;
UUID: 956be907-69e7-351f-863e-71310ba30b82
Materials used for the ventilation system. Transport of the components to the construction site. Disposal of the components included. Influence of ventilation ducts on building construction not included. No materials for renwal of components included. Operation of system not included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Decentral ventilation system including 4 parallel polyethylene ground heat exchanger tubes (200 mm diameter). Air distribution to the 6 decentral ventilation units with a galvanised steel tube (400 mm diameter). Distribution of fresh- and exhaust-air within the flat with polyethylene tubes (75 mm diameter). Exhaust air from the 6 decentral ventilation units with a galvanised steel tube (400 mm diameter) to the exhaust on the roof.
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2003
Production volume: na
Sampling: Questionnaire and assumptions. Data valid for example building used. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_956be907-69e7-351f-863e-71310ba30b82.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
        <shortname xml:lang="en">CH</shortname>
        <comment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Location: &lt;null&gt;</text>
        </comment>
      </geography>
      <technology>
        <comment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Technology: Decentral ventilation system including 4 parallel polyethylene ground heat exchanger tubes (200 mm diameter). Air distribution to the 6 decentral ventilation units with a galvanised steel tube (400 mm diameter). Distribution of fresh- and exhaust-air within the flat with polyethylene tubes (75 mm diameter). Exhaust air from the 6 decentral ventilation units with a galvanised steel tube (400 mm diameter) to the exhaust on the roof.</text>
        </comment>
      </technology>
      <timePeriod startDate="2003-01-01" endDate="2003-12-31" isDataValidForEntirePeriod="true">
        <comment>
